//! Baked animation tables. GENERATED -- do not edit.
//!
//! Produced by `cargo run -p anim --bin bake`, or by the animation hub's
//! save button. The recipes live in `crates/anim/src/clips/`; edit those,
//! or edit them in the hub (F9) and save.
//!
//! Each row is one frame: three numbers for the hip offset in metres,
//! then swing, spread and twist in radians for each of the sixteen
//! joints. Playback is a lookup by frame, so this stays a pure function
//! of simulation state and rollback is unaffected.

